    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4550" root="ثقف" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِقَافَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>use of,</i> or <i>performance with, the
sword;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِقَافٌ</span> [inf. n. of 3, q. v.]. (TA.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ حَسَنُ الثِّقَافَةِ بِالسَّيْفِ</span> [<i>He is good in
respect of performance with the sword</i>]. (TA.)

